class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正因为合并函数有这三条性质，下面这张流程图里的两条同步路径——无论谁先到、是否重复——都收敛到同一终态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;副本 1&lt;br/&gt;本地写入 a&quot;] --&gt; M1[&quot;合并&lt;br/&gt;merge(s1, s2)&quot;]&#10;  B[&quot;副本 2&lt;br/&gt;本地写入 b&quot;] --&gt; M1&#10;  A --&gt; M2[&quot;合并&lt;br/&gt;merge(s2, s1)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; M2&#10;  M1 --&gt; C[&quot;收敛终态&lt;br/&gt;结果唯一&quot;]&#10;  M2 --&gt; C&#10;  R[&quot;重复 / 乱序投递&quot;] --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"副本 1&lt;br/&gt;本地写入 a\"] --&gt; M1[\"合并&lt;br/&gt;merge(s1, s2)\"]\n  B[\"副本 2&lt;br/&gt;本地写入 b\"] --&gt; M1\n  A --&gt; M2[\"合并&lt;br/&gt;merge(s2, s1)\"]\n  B --&gt; M2\n  M1 --&gt; C[\"收敛终态&lt;br/&gt;结果唯一\"]\n  M2 --&gt; C\n  R[\"重复 / 乱序投递\"] --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"它不是银弹\">它不是银弹</h2><p>承诺很美，但代价真实存在，这也是本 hub 最后一章专门讨论 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs\">陷阱与权衡</a> 的原因。CRDT 牺牲的是即时全局一致：读到的可能是尚未收到全部更新的旧值；它需要携带额外元数据（每个元素的唯一标识、版本向量、墓碑），这些元数据会随历史增长而膨胀；删除往往不能真删，要留墓碑标记，否则并发的「删」与「加」无法正确合并。</p>\n<p>更关键的是，CRDT 只保证「收敛到某个确定状态」，不保证「收敛到符合业务语义的状态」。比如银行账户余额不能为负这条不变量，CRDT 的合并并不会替你维护——它能让两个副本算出同一个余额，但那个余额可能是负的。何时该用、何时不该用，需要先理解收敛到底意味着什么，这正是下一篇 <a href=\"eventual-consistency\">最终一致性与收敛</a> 要回答的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CRDT 面向的是「分区期间仍要本地可读写、上线后自动合并」的场景，在 CAP 里站 AP 一侧。</li>\n<li>加锁与共识要求写入前协调，离线场景下不可用；LWW 无需协调但靠丢数据换无冲突。</li>\n<li>CRDT 把无冲突编码进数据类型的合并函数，使其满足结合、交换、幂等三律，于是顺序、重复、分组都不影响最终结果。</li>\n<li>代价是只保证最终一致、需要额外元数据、删除需墓碑，且不自动维护业务不变量。</li>\n<li>接下来：用 <a href=\"eventual-consistency\">最终一致性与收敛</a> 精确化「合并后相等」的语义，再用 <a href=\"crdt-types-overview\">CRDT 类型概览</a> 给所有具体构造定位。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为什么需要 CRDT","id":"为什么需要-crdt"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协调的代价","id":"协调的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"三种老办法的硬伤","id":"三种老办法的硬伤"},{"level":2,"text":"CRDT 的核心承诺","id":"crdt-的核心承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"它不是银弹","id":"它不是银弹"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"最终一致性与收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/foundations/eventual-consistency"}}